      "id": "claim_f87f8e61e5554247a1aab7e7c768e75b",
      "statement": "Scoring arithmetic: unknown criteria (points None) are excluded from both earned and judged_max rather than counted as zero. A pair sharing no place or theme (neither theme nor geography earned points) gets no score. Tiers are strong at 75 or more, medium at 55 or more, otherwise weak, and not_scored when there is no score. Status (met at 80% of max, partial, fail, unknown) is computed from points.",
      "evidence": [
